Real outputs from the Raspberry Pi 5 test Pi (Raspberry Pi OS Lite 64-bit,
Debian 13, kernel 6.18.50+rpt-rpi-2712), captured by tools/pi/collect.sh on
2026-10-10: a 16 GB SD card and Raspberry Pi OS's swap (zram0, backed by loop0
on /var/swap). No USB disk attached. SD card serial anonymized.

